## What Is the CCAR-P Certification?

CCAR-P stands for Claude Certified Architect – Professional. It is a professional-level Anthropic certification associated with advanced Claude architecture and implementation skills.

Candidates preparing for this certification should develop knowledge of areas such as:

- Advanced Claude API integration
- Agentic AI application architecture
- Multi-step agent workflows
- Model Context Protocol (MCP)
- Tool use and orchestration
- Context management
- AI application security
- Testing and evaluation
- System reliability and performance

Refer to the latest official Anthropic certification guide for the current exam objectives and requirements.

