## Important CCAR-P Exam Preparation Topics

### 1. Advanced Claude API Integration

Understand how Claude can be integrated into complex applications.

Important concepts include:

- API request and response handling
- Message structures and context management
- Error handling and retry strategies
- Application-level integration
- Structured outputs

### 2. Agentic AI Architecture

Agentic AI is an important area for professionals working with advanced AI applications.

Focus on:

- Designing multi-step agent workflows
- Planning and executing tasks
- Managing agent state
- Tool selection and execution
- Human approval and escalation
- Handling unexpected agent behavior

### 3. Model Context Protocol (MCP)

MCP enables compatible AI applications to interact with external tools and resources.

Study areas include:

- MCP architecture
- MCP clients and servers
- Tool discovery and execution
- Resource management
- External service integration
- Security and permission management

### 4. Multi-Agent Systems

Understand how multiple specialized agents can work together to complete complex tasks.

Important concepts include:

- Agent orchestration
- Task distribution
- Inter-agent communication
- Workflow coordination
- Context sharing
- Output validation

### 5. Security and Reliability

Advanced AI applications require appropriate security and reliability controls.

Review:

- Prompt injection risks
- Sensitive data protection
- Input validation
- Tool permission controls
- Error recovery
- Monitoring and logging
- Human-in-the-loop safeguards

### 6. Testing and Evaluation

Learn how to evaluate Claude-powered applications and improve their reliability.

Focus on:

- Creating evaluation datasets
- Testing different scenarios
- Measuring response quality
- Identifying inconsistent outputs
- Monitoring application performance
- Improving workflow accuracy

